{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"aeae9e9d-31d6-456f-bc10-45cb809b3630","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have implemented the analytics events from [docs/EVENTS.md](file:///tmp/h-lgOE1A/docs/EVENTS.md) on the registration and offers screens using the existing `Analytics` wrapper.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **[lib/screens/registration_screen.dart](file:///tmp/h-lgOE1A/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)**\n   - **`registration_email_started`**: Triggers once when the user begins typing in the email `TextField` (`text.isNotEmpty`). No PII is attached.\n   - **`registration_phone_started`**: Triggers once when the user begins typing in the phone `TextField` (`text.isNotEmpty`). No PII is attached.\n   - **`loan_amount_changed`**: Triggers when the user moves the loan slider with property `{'amount': amount}` as an `int`. Handled via `onChangeStart`, `onChanged`, and `onChangeEnd` to avoid flooding intermediate drag events while capturing the chosen value.\n   - **`terms_accepted`**: Triggers when the terms and conditions checkbox is ticked (`checked \u0026\u0026 !_terms`), with no properties.\n   - **`registration_continue_tapped`**: Triggers when the user taps Continue with properties `{'amount': _amount.round(), 'terms': _terms}` (`amount` as `int`, `terms` as `bool`) before navigating to `/offers`.\n\n2. **[lib/screens/offer_screen.dart](file:///tmp/h-lgOE1A/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart)**\n   - **`offers_scrolled`**: Wraps `ListView.builder` in a `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` to trigger with `{'offset': notification.metrics.pixels}` as a `double` when the user scrolls the offers list.\n\n3. **[ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-lgOE1A/ANSWER.md)**\n   - Documented the implementation details for all events.\n","duration_seconds":630.858092,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":331563,"output_tokens":49895,"thinking_tokens":39517,"cache_read_tokens":2598840,"total_tokens":381458}}}
